Package: duboisR
Title: Diagnostic Tools for Algorithmic Fairness Auditing (the Wells-Du Bois Protocol)
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Patrick Eugene", "Porché", , "porchewellness@gmail.com",
                   role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Diagnostic engine implementing the Wells-Du Bois Protocol for
    auditing administrative traffic-stop data for encoded enforcement
    discretion. Provides Datasheets-for-Datasets scaffolding (Gebru et al.
    2021), composition and missingness auditing, tendentious-outcome and
    identity-proxy diagnostics, a Veil of Darkness natural-experiment test,
    a fast (non-hierarchical, non-MCMC) approximation to the Threshold Test
    for infra-marginality (Simoiu, Corbett-Davies & Goel 2017), and
    intersectional subpopulation disparity disaggregation (TPR/FPR/PPV
    trade-offs).
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
